      "title": "Now 21% overvalued after recent price rise",
      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has risen 2.4% to ₹101. The fair value is estimated to be ₹83.25, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 16% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has grown by 31%. Revenue is forecast to grow by 33% in 2 years. Earnings are forecast to grow by 25% in the next 2 years.",
