    {
      "id": "b489fc4a-ab1e-434d-9451-56c2ef36805b",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-20T11:36:45.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter dividend of ₹0.12 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹0.12. Ex-date: 25th February 2026 Payment date: 17th April 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.7%, which is about the same as the industry average. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by earnings (23% earnings payout ratio) but the company has no free cash flows available, indicating it may be using cash reserves or debt to pay the dividend. The dividend has increased by an average of 8.6% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 23% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
