      "date": "2026-02-15T23:35:38.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.71 (vs ₹0.51 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.71 (up from ₹0.51 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹30.9b (up 9.5% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.93b (up 39% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.2% (up from 4.9% in 3Q 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 16% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Construction industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 31% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 63% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
